          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Everything you need to quickly and easily understand your cycle in a convenient self-test package.</p><p><strong><br/>Hormonal test</strong></p><p><strong>✓ </strong>Complete look at 6 critical hormones</p><p><strong>✓  </strong>Efficient & non-invasive saliva testing</p><p><strong>✓  </strong>Detailed & understandable report</p><p><strong>✓ </strong>Data stored securely</p><p><strong>✓ </strong>CLIA-certified labs, high standards</p><p></p>",
