    "d8e06245-1144-4aec-aec0-b4660cbe9e70": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--18308929126718__d8e06245-1144-4aec-aec0-b4660cbe9e70-168060164600cd063a-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's included?",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "template--18308929126718__d8e06245-1144-4aec-aec0-b4660cbe9e70-168060164600cd063a-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Detailed Instructions for Saliva Extraction:</span>  </li></ul><p>Clear and easy-to-follow instructions that guide you through the process of collecting your saliva sample effectively.</p><ul><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Sample Accompanying Document: </span></li></ul><p>A document that provides additional information and guidance to ensure accurate and successful sample collection.</p><ul><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Guarantee Certificate:  </span></li></ul><p>Our commitment to delivering reliable results and exceptional service is backed by our guarantee certificate.</p><ul><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Saliva Vessel, Straw, and Labels (3x):  </span></li></ul><p>Specifically designed materials to assist you in collecting and storing your saliva sample securely and conveniently. </p><p><em>Each sample is labeled for accurate identification.</em></p><ul><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Shipping Vessel: </span></li></ul><p> A specialized container to securely package your saliva sample, ensuring its safe transportation to our partner laboratory.</p><ul><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Mailing Bag: </span></li></ul><p> A pre-prepared mailing bag with prepaid shipping, allowing you to easily send your sample back to us for analysis.</p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
