          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>1. Collect Saliva in a Tube: </strong></p><p>Follow the provided instructions to collect your saliva sample using the supplied vessel, straw, and labels.</p><p><strong>2. Send it back to us: </strong></p><p>Place your saliva sample in the prepared shipping vessel, and then put it in the mailing bag. </p><p>Send it back to us using the prepaid shipping option.</p><p><strong>3. Receive your Personalized Report:</strong> </p><p>Our expert team will analyze your sample and generate a comprehensive report. </p><p>Expect to receive your personalized report within approximately 7 days.<br/></p><p><em><br/>*Taking a hormonal test while on hormone pills may yield inaccurate results due to altered hormone levels. Synthetic hormones can interfere with the accuracy of the test in reflecting your natural menstrual cycle.</em><br/><br/></p><p></p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
